And there's a feedback loop there.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.010
And then the end product after that,

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:20.920
of that peer reviewed report
is hopefully published

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.443
and hopefully has an impact,
a positive impact on society.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.710
This process of peer review
