where we're using data to test hypotheses

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:07.740
and get to an answer as a result of that.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.180
So why am I talking about this?

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.620
Well, the first reason of course,

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.490
is that there's considerable
