00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.030
who have had COVID-19

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:16.860
because they want to understand

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.930
their own personal risk going forward,

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.510
