Great, I'm really glad you did.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.723
Now I have another problem for you.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.700
Another question for you.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.940
Maria went to the bread store

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.920
to buy a loaf of bread for dinner.

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.340
She had two quarters, four dimes,

