00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.940
And I'm not actually
gonna ask you to do this

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.440
because, hopefully you've noticed

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.842
that it's the same question.

00:13:38.842 --> 00:13:41.230
So hopefully if I was
to ask you to do this,

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.080
you would just remember
that you'd solved it

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.830
and you wouldn't have to
